{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这么说来，年后就是第三学期了呢」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0670", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……好困」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0671", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太很简洁明了地说明了他现在的状况。", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然每天都会因为社团活动来到学院里，但都是一副睡眠不足的样子。", "text_idx": 185, "plain": "虽然每天都会因为社团活动来到学院里，但都是一副睡眠不足的样子。", "plain_idx": 185, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈啊……新吾，新年有发生什么好事吗？」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0672", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也没啥。隼太你呢？」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什么都没发生。和之前一样睡过去了」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0673", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「和往年一样过了个安稳平和的正月呢」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「别说了。人啊、上了岁数之后就是这样的了，不希望有什么变化……」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": "「别说了。人啊、上了岁数之后就是这样的了，不希望有什么变化……」", "plain_idx": 192, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0674", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这么快就悟道了吗」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你小子有个可爱的女朋友，肯定每天都期待着有什么发生吧～？」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0675", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喂喂喂，别突然不看我啊」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0676", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总而言之，今年也请你多多照顾了」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哦，我也是拜托了」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0677", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉，三年级学生居然是自由上学吗……\\n　这下子和美羽学姐见面的机会骤减了……」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": "「唉，三年级学生居然是自由上学吗……　这下子和美羽学姐见面的机会骤减了……」", "plain_idx": 205, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1601", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没办法，毕竟都是这种时候了」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你就没感到寂寞吗？\\n　平常见不到学姐了……」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": "「你就没感到寂寞吗？　平常见不到学姐了……」", "plain_idx": 209, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1602", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不会这样就寂寞哦」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔哇，立刻就打算交其他的女朋友了」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1603", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你是怎么才能想歪成这样的？」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只是想了一下你这人的品性而已」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1604", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "才刚开始新学期，就立马收到了很严厉的意见。", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然在学校里见面的机会确实变少了，\\n但这部分会在其他地方补上。", "text_idx": 218, "plain": "虽然在学校里见面的机会确实变少了，但这部分会在其他地方补上。", "plain_idx": 219, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且，虽说学姐现在确实是自由上学，\\n但放学后只要打开了这个门——", "text_idx": 220, "plain": "而且，虽说学姐现在确实是自由上学，但放学后只要打开了这个门——", "plain_idx": 221, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，辛苦你们了——」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2067", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜溜～♪」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0404", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "见到这样的笑容还会寂寞的话，也太失礼了。", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊……真想被美羽学姐抱着」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1605", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「想让她带着笑容做这～种事情，还有那～种事情……」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1606", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对于实际被这样做过的人来说，说实在的不推荐。", "text_idx": 233, "plain": "对于实际被这样做过的人来说，说实在的不推荐。", "plain_idx": 233, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被那样子娇惯的话，会有生活障碍的。", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果被她用着那样的笑容说“再多射一些出来”……\\n不对，还真这么说过，那真的会让人变得疯狂的。", "text_idx": 235, "plain": "如果被她用着那样的笑容说“再多射一些出来”……不对，还真这么说过，那真的会让人变得疯狂的。", "plain_idx": 236, "len": 47, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾，已经可以拿出去（射出来）了哦？」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2068", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶诶？！」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……？」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2069", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「快点把这个笼子拿出去。\\n　你真是无论过了多久都这么废物呢」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": "「快点把这个笼子拿出去。　你真是无论过了多久都这么废物呢」", "plain_idx": 243, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1607", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，笼子。好的」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是吧，会变得很难回归正常社会了。", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小熊喵这很危险的，要离开一点哦～？」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2070", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜～」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0405", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼呼。真是个好孩子♪」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2071", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好，我也要加油做个好孩子了。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「看来要出去的不只那个笼子呢。你这个臭虫」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1608", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……我从一开始就不是好孩子了啊。", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾、还在忍耐着吗？」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2072", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，不是……」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好嘛。还这么固执的话……」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2073", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔，啊啊？！」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2074", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……又出来了一堆呢」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2075", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔，学姐……」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是个好孩子……」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2076", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……明明那么努力了，但我还是被当作孩子对待了。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天感觉甚至没坚持五分钟。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我要更加努力点啊。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只不过越来越熟练的学姐真的很恐怖。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，先别动哦。现在正帮你擦干净」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2077", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔，很抱歉……」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐真的很会照顾人。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "剪指甲和掏耳朵就不用说了，还会帮我穿袜子。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，房间里的纸巾不够了……」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2078", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我还带着一包，用这个吧」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2079", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那今天就这样……」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2080", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶？」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊姆，啾、嗯嗯，啾唔、啾、嗯嗯\\n　啾唔……」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": "「啊姆，啾、嗯嗯，啾唔、啾、嗯嗯　啾唔……」", "plain_idx": 286, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2081", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等、学姐……怎么……\\n　啊啊、啊啊啊啊——？！」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": "「等、学姐……怎么……　啊啊、啊啊啊啊——？！」", "plain_idx": 289, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那个清纯的美羽学姐，居然会用“用嘴巴打扫”这种技能。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": "那个清纯的美羽学姐，居然会用“用嘴巴打扫”这种技能。", "plain_idx": 290, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这么幸福真的好吗。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐她在社团活动时和两人独处时的反差真是厉害呢。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": "学姐她在社团活动时和两人独处时的反差真是厉害呢。", "plain_idx": 292, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家肯定都不知道学姐的另一幅样子吧……", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这么想着，我不禁露出了笑容。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜——……溜——……」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "？？？", "alt_speaker_idx": 295, "voice": "pn0406", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "刚刚的是熊喵的叫声吗？", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这么晚了是怎么了吗。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "又听不到了。应该是我的错觉吧。", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我还是先早点回去吧。樱乃要担心了……", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜……」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0407", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
